message:
I am thinking...: Now I can see the vulnerable code clearly at line 725-727:

```c
for (j=0; j < (blob->len-1); j++) {
    oid.value[j] = blob->data[j+1];
}
```

`oid.value` is `int[SC_MAX_OBJECT_ID_OCTETS]` which is `int[16]`. The loop runs for `blob->len - 1` iterations. If `blob->len > 17`, the loop writes past the end of `oid.value[16]`, causing a stack buffer overflow.

Now let me also check what SC_MAX_OBJECT_ID_OCTETS is:

